Error [E0433]: This Sh value is thrown away
  --> origin_marked_text_rejects_raw_sinks.jet:7:8
    |
  7 |     Sh.raw(raw)
    |        ^^^
 Why: `run` has no return type, so it returns nothing and the value of its last line is lost
 Fix: If `run` should return it, write `-> Sh` after its parameter list; to discard it on purpose, write `.drop("reason")`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0433

Error [E0721]: A `$origin.fs` value is denied at `SQL.raw`
  --> tests/ui/taint/origin_marked_text_rejects_raw_sinks.jet:5:9
    |
  5 |     SQL.raw(raw)
    |         ^^^
 Why: The declaration for `$origin.fs` denies `SQL.raw`, which covers this destination
 Fix: Remove the destination use, decode the value into a declared type, or pass it through an audited #Scrub function
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0721

